## To start kafka

Inside /kafka, run:

```
docker compose up -d
```

To create the topic, first go inside the container:

```
docker exec --workdir /opt/kafka/bin/ -it broker sh
```

Creating the topic:
```
./kafka-topics.sh --create --topic scream --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --partitions 3 --replication-factor 1
```

## Start Go Producer server

Inside producer folder:
```
go run main.go
```